// Deployed site (SPEC §K): `npm run web:deploy`. Static files come from dist-web
// (`npm run web:build`); the Worker only answers /api/* (cloud sync, worker/api.ts).
{
  "name": "tcf-site",
  "main": "worker/index.ts",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-10-01",
  "workers_dev": true,
  // per-version preview URLs would bypass the Access login on the workers.dev name
  "preview_urls": false,
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./dist-web",
    "binding": "ASSETS",
    "not_found_handling": "single-page-application",
    "run_worker_first": ["/api/*"]
  },
  "d1_databases": [
    { "binding": "DB", "database_name": "tcf-sync", "database_id": "<npx wrangler d1 create tcf-sync 的输出>", "migrations_dir": "migrations" }
  ],
  // filled in after the Access application exists (Zero Trust › Access › Applications)
  "vars": { "ACCESS_TEAM_DOMAIN": "", "ACCESS_AUD": "" }
}
